                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines the order of the scheduler predecessors.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This value has to be understood as a relative value, i.e. the value shows only the relative ordering of the elements. The highest value has the highest priority and gaps are allowed (not dense based). The values need to be unique within one EthSwtPortScheduler.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthSwt_00020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
